---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Timeline of the GitLab database incident from the postmortem; evenly spaced, not to scale.
---
<figure class="rf">
  <div class="rf-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 380" role="img" aria-label="GitLab, 31 January 2017, times in UTC. 17:20 an LVM snapshot is taken for staging. 19:00 database load rises. 23:00 replica db2 falls behind and must be rebuilt. 23:30 the data directory is wiped on db1 by mistake, about 300 GB. About 00:00 recovery from the 17:20 snapshot, losing about six hours.">
    <line x1="40" y1="196" x2="860" y2="196" class="edge " />
    <rect x="5" y="20" width="190" height="104" rx="4" class="box ok" />
    <text x="18" y="44" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>17:20</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>17:20</tspan></text>
    <text x="18" y="66" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Snapshot of production</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chụp snapshot production</tspan></text>
    <text x="18" y="84" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>taken to load staging</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>để nạp vào staging</tspan></text>
    <line x1="100" y1="124" x2="100" y2="180" class="edge " />
    <DiagramIcon name="backup" x={100} y={196} size={28} />
    <rect x="180" y="262" width="190" height="104" rx="4" class="box" />
    <text x="193" y="286" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>19:00</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>19:00</tspan></text>
    <text x="193" y="308" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Load rises: spam, plus a</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tải tăng: spam, cộng một</tspan></text>
    <text x="193" y="326" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>job deleting an account</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>job đang xoá một tài khoản</tspan></text>
    <line x1="275" y1="212" x2="275" y2="262" class="edge " />
    <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={275} y={196} size={28} />
    <rect x="355" y="20" width="190" height="104" rx="4" class="box" />
    <text x="368" y="44" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>23:00</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>23:00</tspan></text>
    <text x="368" y="66" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>db2 falls behind; the WAL</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>db2 tụt lại; WAL nó cần</tspan></text>
    <text x="368" y="84" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>it needs is gone, so it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đã mất, nên phải dựng</tspan></text>
    <text x="368" y="102" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>must be rebuilt</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lại từ đầu</tspan></text>
    <line x1="450" y1="124" x2="450" y2="180" class="edge " />
    <DiagramIcon name="postgres" x={450} y={196} size={28} />
    <rect x="530" y="262" width="190" height="104" rx="4" class="box bad" />
    <text x="543" y="286" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>23:30</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>23:30</tspan></text>
    <text x="543" y="308" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Data directory wiped on</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Xoá thư mục data trên</tspan></text>
    <text x="543" y="326" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>db1, not db2: about</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>db1 thay vì db2: khoảng</tspan></text>
    <text x="543" y="344" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>300 GB gone</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>300 GB mất</tspan></text>
    <line x1="625" y1="212" x2="625" y2="262" class="edge " />
    <DiagramIcon name="fail" x={625} y={196} size={28} />
    <rect x="705" y="20" width="190" height="104" rx="4" class="box ok" />
    <text x="718" y="44" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>00:00</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>00:00</tspan></text>
    <text x="718" y="66" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Restore the 17:20 snapshot:</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khôi phục snapshot 17:20:</tspan></text>
    <text x="718" y="84" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>about 6 hours of</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mất khoảng 6 tiếng</tspan></text>
    <text x="718" y="102" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>changes are lost</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thay đổi</tspan></text>
    <line x1="800" y1="124" x2="800" y2="180" class="edge " />
    <DiagramIcon name="retry" x={800} y={196} size={28} />
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Times are in UTC and the spacing is not to scale. The two gold cards are the snapshot that saved GitLab and what restoring it cost.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giờ UTC, khoảng cách không theo tỉ lệ. Hai thẻ vàng là snapshot đã cứu GitLab và cái giá của việc khôi phục từ nó.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .rf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .rf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .rf text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .rf .t-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-hs { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .t-mono { font-size: 12px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .t-ok { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .rf .box.strong { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.empty { fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .rf .box.bad.empty { fill: none; }
  .rf .edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .rf .edge.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.ok { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .head.bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .rf .head.ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .rf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
